dialect protocol
protocol stdio.html.diff
version 1
schema stdio.html
start record

# `HtmlDiff` carries `doctype` (unchanged, removed or set) and `root` (unchanged, a sparse element/text/attribute edit, or a wholesale
# `Replace` of the root node). Its binary form is the UTF-8 bytes of `print_diff`'s bracket-token text, verbatim: `encode_diff` and
# `decode_diff` in the sibling `🦀️.rs` are a pure text-to-bytes passthrough, so the frame is exactly one opaque payload.
framing record
chain payload bytes
